{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the spinning world of <strong>Spin Shop Simulator</strong>! You're the owner of a specialty store where customizing, selling, and showcasing spinning tops is your daily grind. Balance business and creativity as you grow your shop into a local hotspot for spinner enthusiasts.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/title_pvpbattle.png?t=1746190843\" />\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/gif-duel.gif?t=1746190843\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join PVP Battles, Dominate the Arena, and Prove You're the Ultimate Spinner Master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/title_watchbattle.png?t=1746190843\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/gif-battle.gif?t=1746190843\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set up arenas where NPCs battle with their spins. Organize full-scale tournaments to increase foot traffic and prestige. Watch matches live \u2014 and test your own designs in the ring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/title_loot.png?t=1746190843\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/gif-open.gif?t=1746190843\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open suprize boxes to discover rare parts and legendary spinners. Find valuable pieces, upgrade your shop's collection, or build the ultimate custom spinner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/title_customization.png?t=1746190843\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/gif-modify.gif?t=1746190843\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine different parts to create powerful, unique spinners. Display them on exclusive stands, price them higher, or keep them in your personal collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/title_tournament.png?t=1746190843\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/gif-tournament.gif?t=1746190843\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Organize tournaments to draw crowds, boost sales, and let players battle it out with their custom builds. Watch your shop become the hottest spot in town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfea <strong>Customize Your Shop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arrange shelves, furniture, and battle arenas to your liking. Make your shop not just a place to buy Spins, but a place where players want to hang out and compete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Manage Your Inventory</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Order stock from suppliers, organize your shelves, and decide which items to display front and center. Common parts or premium, high-tier pieces \u2014 it\u2019s up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Set Prices &amp; Handle Sales</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your pricing strategy. Undercut competitors or focus on rare and high-margin products. NPCs will browse, buy, and react to your prices and displays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddf0 <strong>Decorate and Enhance Your Shop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add posters, lighting, and themed d\u00e9cor to give your shop a personal touch. Improve customer experience and influence their spending behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddf1 <strong>Expand Your Storefront</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new rooms, upgrade your interior, and build the ultimate Spin Shop destination. More space means more products, more arenas, and more action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf10 <strong>Expand and Evolve</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As your business grows, unlock new customization options, arena types, and special edition parts. Build your brand in the local spinner scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're in it for the business or the battles, <strong>Spin Shop Simulator</strong> puts the spin in simulation.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3695600?t=1746190843","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3695600?t=1746190843","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/a59f21ec30c66fe9dc5eab608763df831667d1c1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746190843","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/a59f21ec30c66fe9dc5eab608763df831667d1c1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746190843","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the spinning world of <strong>Spin Shop Simulator</strong>! You're the owner of a specialty store where customizing, selling, and showcasing spinning tops is your daily grind. Balance business and creativity as you grow your shop into a local hotspot for spinner enthusiasts.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/title_pvpbattle.png?t=1746190843\" />\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/gif-duel.gif?t=1746190843\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join PVP Battles, Dominate the Arena, and Prove You're the Ultimate Spinner Master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/title_watchbattle.png?t=1746190843\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/gif-battle.gif?t=1746190843\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set up arenas where NPCs battle with their spins. Organize full-scale tournaments to increase foot traffic and prestige. Watch matches live \u2014 and test your own designs in the ring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/title_loot.png?t=1746190843\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/gif-open.gif?t=1746190843\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open suprize boxes to discover rare parts and legendary spinners. Find valuable pieces, upgrade your shop's collection, or build the ultimate custom spinner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/title_customization.png?t=1746190843\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/gif-modify.gif?t=1746190843\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine different parts to create powerful, unique spinners. Display them on exclusive stands, price them higher, or keep them in your personal collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/title_tournament.png?t=1746190843\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/gif-tournament.gif?t=1746190843\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Organize tournaments to draw crowds, boost sales, and let players battle it out with their custom builds. Watch your shop become the hottest spot in town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfea <strong>Customize Your Shop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arrange shelves, furniture, and battle arenas to your liking. Make your shop not just a place to buy Spins, but a place where players want to hang out and compete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Manage Your Inventory</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Order stock from suppliers, organize your shelves, and decide which items to display front and center. Common parts or premium, high-tier pieces \u2014 it\u2019s up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Set Prices &amp; Handle Sales</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your pricing strategy. Undercut competitors or focus on rare and high-margin products. NPCs will browse, buy, and react to your prices and displays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddf0 <strong>Decorate and Enhance Your Shop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add posters, lighting, and themed d\u00e9cor to give your shop a personal touch. Improve customer experience and influence their spending behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddf1 <strong>Expand Your Storefront</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new rooms, upgrade your interior, and build the ultimate Spin Shop destination. More space means more products, more arenas, and more action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf10 <strong>Expand and Evolve</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As your business grows, unlock new customization options, arena types, and special edition parts. Build your brand in the local spinner scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're in it for the business or the battles, <strong>Spin Shop Simulator</strong> puts the spin in simulation.</p>","developers":["MD2TA"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/5e4abeca8f960996eef7222eb3c84b16a3086af2/header.jpg?t=1746190843","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257131436,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131436/movie480.mp4?t=1746190756","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131436/movie_max.mp4?t=1746190756"},"name":"Trailer_Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257131436/db2cce2e4110be6073e3ffd95347ed612390e44f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746190756","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto